 "remarks": "Light-filled and completely renovated, this 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath townhouse is move-in ready from the moment you walk in. Updated appliances and an abundance of natural light set the tone throughout.  Upstairs, three bedrooms offer comfortable space for everyone, with a pull-down attic for generous storage. The lower level adapts to the way you live: use it as a private primary suite with its own full bath, or as a home office, playroom, or guest retreat. In-unit laundry is on the lower level as well.  Step outside to two decks made for summer dinners, morning coffee, and easy entertaining. An under-house garage keeps your car out of the elements, and tenants are responsible only for gas, electric, and internet.  Enjoy beach days just moments from your door, with a short drive to both the Greenwich and Port Chester train stations for an easy commute into the city.  Homes like this don't stay available long. Schedule your showing today.",
